{"3506500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hyperreal Rock in a Surreal World", "steam_appid": 3506500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Get Ready for an Extreme Challenge: Tough, Frustrating, and Ridiculously Addictive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a surreal universe where you become a <strong>hyper-realistic stone</strong>, torn from its original painting. Now you're trapped in a strange and illogical world, and there's only one way to escape: <strong>reach the top</strong>. Easy to understand, nearly impossible to achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 <strong>Unique Mechanics</strong>: Throw the stone with precision, but be careful... <strong>you can only launch it twice in a row</strong> before waiting for it to recharge. Can you stay calm while gravity and absurd level design conspire against you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📌 <strong>Challenging platforms</strong> – Jump, roll, and slide through bizarre landscapes.<br>📌 <strong>Surreal obstacles</strong> – Face challenges that question logic while managing your own sanity.<br>📌 <strong>Guaranteed frustration</strong> – Experience the pain of falling into the abyss just when you thought you had made it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Are you ready to test your limits?</strong><br>Prepare to fall. And fall again. Because here, <strong>every throw matters, and every mistake is felt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔔 <strong>Warning</strong>: Only recommended for players with nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove that even a simple stone can reach the stars.</strong> 🌌</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Get Ready for an Extreme Challenge: Tough, Frustrating, and Ridiculously Addictive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a surreal universe where you become